DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppggmmttoossbbiigg  reads  a PGM image as input and produces a Santa Barbara In‐
       strument Group SBIG Type 3 image as output.

       Note that this format is distinct from the SBIG ST-4 format.



       •      The image is uncompressed

       •      The image says it is from a "ST-6" camera

       •      The image header has these lines:


       •      camera type

       •      height

       •      width

       •      saturation level





OOPPTTIIOONNSS
